1
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,700
My Lady,

2
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:45,780
please take the medicine first.

3
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,120
Cuijuan,

4
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,840
please deliver this letter

5
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,920
to Su...

6
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,520
to Mr. Chu Nanfeng in person.

7
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:57,460
Tell him

8
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:58,460
to meet me at the old place.

9
00:00:59,260 --> 00:00:59,980
Yes, My Lady.

10
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:06,240
My Lady, please take the medicine.

11
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,860
What's this?

12
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:17,260
It's a Zutai Medicine given by the Old Lady.

13
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:20,220
She also told me to drink it for half a month.

14
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:23,000
She has the maid bring it to you every day.

15
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,160
If you find it bitter,

16
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:26,860
I'll make some osmanthus candied fruit for you.

17
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,240
I see. You can go.

18
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:29,880
OK.

19
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:50,620
What are you doing?

20
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,340
Don't be afraid, baby.

21
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:53,840
I'm here.

22
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:02,520
Don't be so high and mighty.

23
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,200
Once my sister

24
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,880
becomes the Young Madam,

25
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,960
the Ling family

26
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,240
will be ours.

27
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,840
You'll be rich and powerful.

28
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:10,060
Just do as I say.

29
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,260
Miss,

30
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,100
are you alright?

31
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,620
What does this have to do with you?

32
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:19,560
What do you want?

33
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:20,580
Trying to steal my thunder?

34
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,080
I'll teach you a lesson!

35
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,440
[I thought she was being bullied,]

36
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,620
[but it turns out to be a ruse.]

37
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:27,780
Your guest hasn't arrived yet.

38
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,840
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

39
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,280
Xiaobai.

40
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,300
Sis.

41
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:36,180
Sis.

42
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,000
She...

43
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:38,600
Sis.

44
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:40,540
What did Xiaobai do wrong

45
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:41,500
to do this to him?

46
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:43,560
He's just a kid!

47
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,480
A kid?

48
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:49,740
He's a big kid!

49
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,120
Cousin,

50
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,280
I suspect

51
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:53,680
Xiaobai must have

52
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,700
caught you and Chu Nanfeng in the act,

53
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,720
which led to his brutal murder.

54
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,080
This letter says

55
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,480
you asked Chu Nanfeng to come to this room.

56
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:01,480
Come out.

57
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:06,460
Young Madam, please spare me.

58
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,420
Young Marshal and Miss Ye

59
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,980
saw me delivering the letter.

60
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,040
I dare not lie.

61
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,680
I can only tell the truth.

62
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,080
Cuijuan.

63
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,760
Do you know?

64
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,880
You smell so good.

65
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:22,840
This is the only box of Xiangfen Shuidiao Getou

66
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,000
in Yang City.

67
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,400
The scent can last a month.

68
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,740
If someone opens the letter,

69
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:28,980
she will be infected with this scent.

70
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:30,780
What are you talking about?

71
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,620
I don't understand.

72
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:33,960
I just asked my sister

73
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,520
to arrange a meeting with Chu Nanfeng.

74
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,660
Are you implying

75
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,160
my sister is shameless?

76
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,680
Yang City,

77
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,960
you're so unreasonable.

78
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,280
I can't even

79
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,900
meet my sister?

80
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,360
Young Marshal,

81
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,540
why didn't you

82
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:48,960
tell me about the rules?

83
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,240
Miss Ye,

84
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,760
since you like my servant so much,

85
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,220
I'll give her to you

86
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,280
as a gift.

87
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,400
Cuijuan,

88
00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:02,160
I think Miss Ye likes you very much.

89
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,380
You two are also fated.

90
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:06,180
Why don't you be together?

91
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,200
Brother.

92
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:11,640
Let's go.

93
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,560
Let's go.

94
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,320
This is just a trap I set.

95
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,520
Thank you for your concern.

96
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,460
Su Muwan.

97
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,960
I'm just afraid of losing you.

98
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,360
Xiaobei.

99
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,120
Let's go to the hospital.

100
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,160
Qingming,

101
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,940
try this.

102
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,820
I brought it back from abroad.

103
00:04:39,940 --> 00:04:40,740
It's really good.

104
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:42,820
Young Madam,

105
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:44,820
I'm sent here by Master Su Hong

106
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,180
to serve you.

107
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,360
I see.

108
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,020
You can go now.

109
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:49,780
Yes.

110
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:54,500
Qianyue,

111
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,600
take me

112
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,880
to the garden.

113
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:58,740
I heard Huai is there.

114
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:01,000
Huai.

115
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,960
Come on, we'll see.

116
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:09,860
This one looks good.

117
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,560
And a bow.

118
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:13,840
This one is suitable.

119
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,000
These shoes match the dress.

120
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,380
Your dress is pretty too.

121
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,800
Yeah, I think so.

122
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,680
You're a fake.

123
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,180
You don't like her?

124
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:27,620
No.

125
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:29,760
She's about to become your sister-in-law.

126
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,780
The Ye family

127
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:31,780
is like a bloodsucking leech,

128
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,020
clinging to our Ling family.

129
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:34,740
They make my brother arrange things

130
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:35,620
and take care of business.

131
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:37,360
I don't want such a person to be my sister-in-law.

132
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,420
After all, Ye Family is your grandmother's family.

133
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,120
Keep your voice down.

134
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,860
That's right.

135
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:43,920
Every woman

136
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:44,780
in Ye Family

137
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,160
is a blood bank for men.

138
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:48,440
Now it's a society of gender equality.

139
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,480
Ye Family

140
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,900
has set too many rules for women.

141
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,080
Let's go.

142
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,080
Leave them alone.

143
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:53,680
Okay.

144
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,480
It's done.

145
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,000
You're in love.

146
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,320
I really miss

147
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:22,860
the time when I wasn't a witch.

148
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:23,880
Yes.

149
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:24,780
Qianyue,

150
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,220
what were you talking about?

151
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:28,160
I said,

152
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,540
why bother?

153
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,660
You'll see him soon,

154
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,820
and even sing for him.

155
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,720
Oh, no,

156
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:34,860
you can't do that.

157
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,260
Qianyue,

158
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,220
look, look,

159
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:37,940
that's him.

160
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,160
Isn't he handsome?

161
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,780
Just so so,

162
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,480
not as handsome as my brother.

163
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:44,980
You really have no taste.

164
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,560
You!

165
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,700
So rude!

166
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:56,180
As an unmarried girl,

167
00:06:56,180 --> 00:06:57,220
who allowed you to meet those men in the garden?

168
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:58,020
who allowed you to meet those men in the garden?

169
00:06:58,020 --> 00:06:59,580
After two years of study,

170
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,060
you've become too independent.

171
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:01,080
I'm just telling the truth.

172
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,640
Ye Jinrou is also unmarried.

173
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,360
Why am I the only one being punished?

174
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,100
Madam,

175
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,720
Xueqiu is right.

176
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:09,120
I am unmarried,

177
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,580
and I shouldn't have been in the garden.

178
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:11,920
But I thought,

179
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:12,920
since I will be

180
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,160
getting married soon,

181
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,960
it would be good to get familiar with it.

182
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:16,620
Madam,

183
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,560
it's all my fault.

184
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,080
It's clearly your fault!

185
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:20,480
Why are you pretending to be a good person?

186
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:21,260
Damn it!

187
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:22,480
Shut up!

188
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:23,860
You made a mistake first,

189
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,580
and then you didn't respect the elder.

190
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:28,660
Jinrou is your future sister-in-law.

191
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:30,120
What kind of sister-in-law is she?

192
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:32,180
Su Muwan is the only sister-in-law.

193
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:34,840
You...

194
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:37,820
I'll beat you.

195
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,080
How dare you!

196
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,080
I...

197
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,420
You...

198
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,400
No way.

199
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:55,380
I took Xueqiu to the garden.

200
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:56,920
I have to protect her.

201
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:01,620
Madam,

202
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:03,760
this is my fault.

203
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:04,940
I'm willing to be punished.

204
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,060
Fuyuan.

205
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:08,720
Yes.

206
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:10,480
Take her away.

207
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:12,420
Copy the "Women's Rules" and "Women's Precepts" 300 times.

208
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:14,680
Let's go, Young Madam.

209
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,960
Young Madam,

210
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:34,020
you must think carefully.

211
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,700
With such a careless attitude,

212
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,920
you can't be the hostess of the mansion.

213
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,120
Look at this handwriting,

214
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:46,500
crooked and

215
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,660
disordered.

216
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:50,620
It doesn't show any sincerity from you.

217
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,380
Are you trying to get by

218
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:56,400
with this kind of thing?

219
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:04,260
This is written by our Young Madam herself.

220
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,360
For Xueqiu, I'll tolerate you.

221
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,820
But don't go too far.

222
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:14,280
You...

223
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,400
How dare you

224
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,820
speak to me like that?

225
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,920
I'm sent by the Old Madam.

226
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,380
Xiaoxue.

227
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:22,700
Stamp on it.
